config BR2_PACKAGE_MIYOO_CTL
	bool "miyoo-ctl"
	help
	  Hardware control CLI for the Allwinner suniv handheld family:
	  volume, rumble, panel/keypad/layout revision selection -
	  the userland side of the family kernel's miyoo modules, used
	  by scripts and by miyoo-daemon's hotkeys.

	  https://github.com/MiyooCFW/miyooctl
